items.doc:
Same as `Dict.fold`, except you can stop folding early.

```roc
expect Dict.empty()
           .insert("Apples", 12.U64)
           .insert("Oranges", 24)
           .fold_until(0, |count, _key, qty| if count + qty >= 30 {
               Break(count + qty)
           } else {
               Continue(count + qty)
           }) == 36
```

